        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game description was generated with AI. The game does not have English support. However, We would like to support English in the future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding, and please stay tuned for further announcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Code</i> is the next-generation sci-fi mystery brought to you by the creators of <i>The Witch of Ihanashi</i>, a doujin visual novel that sold over 30,000 copies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to unravel an <strong>extraordinary mystery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While <i>Stellar Code</i> is a mystery visual novel, it deviates from traditional formats—there’s no need to identify culprits or decode intricate tricks.<br>Instead, the mystery you must solve is a <strong>cosmic enigma</strong> rooted in the wonders of space and theoretical physics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Prior Knowledge Required</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t need a background in science to enjoy this story.<br>The keys to solving the mystery will be revealed as you progress through the narrative.<br>All you need to do is question the unknown alongside the characters and immerse yourself in the unfolding story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Visual Novel Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a visual novel, the primary focus is on <strong>following the story</strong> and uncovering its secrets.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game description was generated with AI. The game does not have English support. However, We would like to support English in the future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding, and please stay tuned for further announcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Code</i> is the next-generation sci-fi mystery brought to you by the creators of <i>The Witch of Ihanashi</i>, a doujin visual novel that sold over 30,000 copies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to unravel an <strong>extraordinary mystery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While <i>Stellar Code</i> is a mystery visual novel, it deviates from traditional formats—there’s no need to identify culprits or decode intricate tricks.<br>Instead, the mystery you must solve is a <strong>cosmic enigma</strong> rooted in the wonders of space and theoretical physics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Prior Knowledge Required</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t need a background in science to enjoy this story.<br>The keys to solving the mystery will be revealed as you progress through the narrative.<br>All you need to do is question the unknown alongside the characters and immerse yourself in the unfolding story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Visual Novel Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a visual novel, the primary focus is on <strong>following the story</strong> and uncovering its secrets.</p>",
        "short_description": "Mysterious phenomena from space. A researcher's fatal accident. Cryptic codes engraved on an unknown material. Together with your brilliant sister-in-law, you must unravel a mystery that could determine the fate of Earth. A sci-fi mystery visual novel of discovery and suspense.",
